# Protocol

Single source of truth: `crates/protocol/schema/evohime.protocol.schema.json`

## Workflow

1. Edit JSON Schema
2. Mirror changes in `crates/protocol/src/lib.rs` (Rust enums with `#[serde(rename)]`)
3. Run `npm run generate:protocol`
4. Update `frontend/web/src/protocol.ts` re-exports if new types added

## Event naming

Use dotted names: `session.created`, `task.started`, `agent.message.delta`, etc.

## Types

- `ServerEvent` — server → client (tagged union via `type` field)
- `ClientCommand` — client → server
- `HistoryItem` — `{ sequence, created_at, event }` (not in schema, defined manually in TS)
- `SessionBootstrap` — `{ session_id, created_at, events: HistoryItem[] }`
